{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209658-the-caul","id":1209658,"title":"The Caul","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-21T09:28:13-07:00","id":1209658,"title":"The Caul","content":"What is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1887-colognian","name":"Colognian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T09:42:37-07:00","id":1209668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Colognian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209658-the-caul#post1209658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you asking for speculation or to be informed about what\u2019s already known from the 3E corebook?<br /> <br /> It\u2019s that huge island/small continent in the Southwest that was added in 3rd edition. It\u2019s sacred to both Lunars and Dragon-Blooded because of a union of Luna and Gaia that occurred there. Most of it is Lunar controlled, but the Realm has walled shrine cities that Dragon-Blooded make pilgrimage too for mystic benefit, assuming they survive the endless conflict with the Lunars there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-21-2018, 12:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T10:09:31-07:00","id":1209679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209658-the-caul?p=1209668#post1209668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you asking for speculation or to be informed about what\u2019s already known from the 3E corebook?<br /> <br /> It\u2019s that huge island/small continent in the Southwest that was added in 3rd edition. It\u2019s sacred to both Lunars and Dragon-Blooded because of a union of Luna and Gaia that occurred there. Most of it is Lunar controlled, but the Realm has walled shrine cities that Dragon-Blooded make pilgrimage too for mystic benefit, assuming they survive the endless conflict with the Lunars there.</div> </div> </div> </div>The preview from The Realm that just dropped says it's sacred to the Dragon-Blooded because it was the mythic home of the Five Elemental Dragons, and the claimed cradle of the Dragon-Blooded.<br /> <br /> If the five shrine cities are all under Dragon-Blooded control, then the gates to otherworldly Feng-Yi, the Last City, open, and it becomes possible for a Dragon-Blooded to make pilgrimage there to guarantee their next child will also Exalt as a Dragon-Blood.<br /> <br /> If the shrine cities are all under Lunar control... no-one knows, but it's believed the gates to Feng-Yi might open the other way, and Lunars could pilgrimage there to claim lost wonders and miracles.<br /> <br /> Currently, the Lunars hold four shrine cities, the Dragon-Blooded one.<br /> <br /> Beyond that, the Lunars also want the Caul as a potential staging ground for final war against the Realm.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T10:19:16-07:00","id":1209684,"title":"","content":"Okay thanks for the Information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1887-colognian","name":"Colognian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T11:04:03-07:00","id":1209698,"title":"","content":"Fauxi-on-the-Caul seems to be the hub city of <i>Monster Hunter World</i>. From a certain point of view.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"